    <div class="container">

        <span class="ghost-line">"To you, I am a private bridge. To the world, you are a Ghost."</span>

        <section>
            <p>Most "secure" messengers still collect user data. They force phone numbers during sign-up, index contacts on central servers, and expose user activity graphs. I engineered StateZerØ under the strict doctrine of Blind by Default. My infrastructure operates purely as a stateless, zero-visibility transport relay. My server is structurally and mathematically incapable of seeing usernames, reading messages, viewing attachments, tracking IP addresses, or identifying user networks.</p>
            
            <h3 style="color: var(--ghost-neon-green); text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 1.1em; margin-top: 25px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ghost-dark-green); padding-bottom: 8px;">⚡ Feature Comparison: StateZerØ vs. Mainstream Apps</h3>
            <div style="overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; margin: 15px 0; border: 1px solid var(--ghost-neon-green);">
                <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.85em; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; min-width: 600px;">
                    <thead>
                        <tr style="background-color: rgba(39, 174, 96, 0.2);">
                            <th style="border: 1px solid var(--ghost-neon-green); padding: 8px; text-align: left; color: var(--ghost-neon-green); text-transform: uppercase;">Feature</th>
                            <th style="border: 1px solid var(--ghost-neon-green); padding: 8px; text-align: left; color: var(--ghost-neon-green); text-transform: uppercase;">WhatsApp</th>
                            <th style="border: 1px solid var(--ghost-neon-green); padding: 8px; text-align: left; color: var(--ghost-neon-green); text-transform: uppercase;">Signal</th>
                            <th style="border: 1px solid var(--ghost-neon-green); padding: 8px; text-align: left; color: var(--ghost-neon-green); text-transform: uppercase;">StateZerØ</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
